The page says the first three turn on an OAuth grant outliving its reason, and that 0ktapus reaches the same MFA conclusion by a different route.
notes:
Four related kill chains on csoh.org.

At stage 02, the page says the general shape recurs across this site: Vercel / Context.ai, Salesloft Drift and UNC6040 all turn on an OAuth grant outliving the reason it was made.

In its defenses, the page calls enforcing phishing-resistant MFA with no environment-based exceptions the same conclusion as 0ktapus, arriving by a completely different route.

